Episode 2:            Umaru and Alex

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:29.500
Umaru, this is serious! Our anime has started up again!

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:32.000
Episode 2:            Umaru and Alex

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:32.000
Jeez, just relax, Big Brother.

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:33.620
Episode 2:            Umaru and Alex

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:33.620
I didn't expect you to be so calm...

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:34.620
Episode 2:            Umaru and Alex

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:38.120
Episode 2:            Umaru and Alex

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:38.120
I... I CAN HAVE MY OWN THOUGHTS ABOUT STUFF

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:38.120
AND THE STUFF I THINK ABOUT IS MINE AND STUFF!

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:39.750
Episode 2:            Umaru and Alex

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:39.750
You're the one who needs to relax.

